	(text "Filter (decided 2026-11-22, PA-4): 10k / 10n, then two real poles 47k / 220n twice (5.3 and 40 Hz, -3 dB 5.0 Hz), gain 10.0 (9.09k / 1.01k 0.1 %): 10 V/A. Trip 25 ms after a step to 400 mA, 45-50 ms after a mirror short; 13 mA pp ripple at 82 Hz full overdrive (bias_supply.md). 1R shunt 1 %, 50 ppm/K."
