	(text "Schmitt buffer U405: the slow RC edge of OC_ANY_N and the comparator-driven BIAS_OK_PRE into CMOS inputs. Latch: any comparator low -> ~R low -> OC_OK = 0 (tripped). Power-on: 100k / 1u holds ~R low about 70 ms -> starts tripped. OC_CLR rising edge clocks D = OC_ANY_N: clears only if no comparator is tripped. OC_OK -> HV_PERMIT (both switches) and OC_TRIP_N (sheet 05)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 335.28 149.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "500b816a-ff4c-5814-80d2-919ae0aba333")
	)
